3. ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENT — Marking of modified versions  [§ 7(c)]
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

If you convey a modified version of the Program, you must mark it in
reasonable ways as different from the original version, and you must not
misrepresent its origin. In particular, a modified version must not be
presented in a way that suggests it is the original Phantom P2P or that it
is endorsed by the original author.

